  "name": "Personality Inventory for DSM-5 – Short Form (PID-5-SF)",
  "short_name": null,
  "language": "en",
  "description": "The Personality Inventory for DSM-5 – Short Form (PID-5-SF) is a 100-item self-report measure designed to assess maladaptive personality traits. It measures 25 personality facets as well as traditional personality disorders. The scale is accompanied by the Personality Inventory for DSM-5 – Adaptive , which selectively administers items most likely to provide clinically meaningful information.",
